 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by fun games from the 90s, with updated visuals and retro-themed game design that focuses on gameplay. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game targets a native 100-120FPS.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["Solar Lunar Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164520/header.jpg?t=1764860875","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3164520/833694/d42e7f8ddab4edca57dcfec848e13a3f093e3428/1750876764/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740301495","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3164520/833694/d42e7f8ddab4edca57dcfec848e13a3f093e3428/1750876764/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740301495","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3164520/833694/d42e7f8ddab4edca57dcfec848e13a3f093e3428/1750876764/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740301495","id":257101257,"name":"Teddy Roller 1 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101257/1a659314991e56cd035d9cef3a152cda738ce54f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740301495"}],"name":"Teddy Roller 1","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Teddy Roller 1 - $6.99 USD","packageid":1122997,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":699}],"title":"Buy Teddy Roller 1"}],"packages":[1122997],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><st